    "description": "Thirteen Default\\_\\* fields on Account are inert. Three have no Deal counterpart at all, and one has an API-name mismatch.\n\nEither the cascade gets built or the fields get removed. Leaving them populated-but-ignored is the WORST option, because Ops will reasonably assume they do something and configure against them.\n\nDecide with Emily, then:\n\n* If building: map each Default\\_\\* to its Deal counterpart, create the three missing fields, fix the API-name mismatch, cascade on Deal CREATE only (not update, or it overwrites deliberate deal-level overrides)\n\n* If deferring: delete or hide the fields from all layouts and log the deferral in the decision log so it is a decision, not a loose end\n\nEffort: \\~6h if built.\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §5.",
